title: Registry results show icon, downloads, stars and whether each works here; a click on a row opens its page (README, features, changelog), its Install button installs it, and the page then shows its runtime status
folders: rust-small
openvsx: on
expect-log: the page of qa-tools\.bru-lite shows its Details \(not available yet: Custom editors: Bru Request Editor · Keyboard shortcuts \(2\) · Menu entries: in editor/title
expect-log: the page of qa-tools\.bru-lite shows its Features
expect-log: the page of qa-tools\.bru-lite shows its Changelog
expect-log: the page of qa-tools\.lint-plus shows its Details \(works in Code Canvas; registry ready\)
expect-log: the page of qa-tools\.web-only shows its Details \(not available yet: Its code: it is written only for VS Code in a browser
expect-log: the page of qa-tools\.nobody shows its Details \(manifest failed; registry failed\)
expect-file: {WORK}\data\extensions\qa-tools.bru-lite-1.2.0\package.json :: "name": "bru-lite"
expect-file: {WORK}\data\extensions\qa-tools.bru-lite-1.2.0\README.md :: Send API requests without leaving the editor

wait 2500
ext-search qa
wait 2500
mark results
wait 600
ext qa-tools.bru-lite
wait 2500
mark details
wait 600
ext features
wait 1500
mark features
wait 600
ext changelog
wait 1500
mark changelog
wait 600
ui click 190 280
wait 2000
mark works-here
wait 600
ext qa-tools.web-only
wait 2000
mark web-only
wait 600
ext qa-tools.nobody
wait 2000
mark not-on-registry
wait 600
ui click 295 231
wait 3500
ext qa-tools.bru-lite
wait 2000
mark installed
wait 600
ext runtime
wait 1200
mark runtime
wait 600
ui click 1672 70
wait 800
ext-search
wait 1500
mark installed-list
wait 400
ui click 230 212
wait 2500
mark opened-by-its-card
wait 600
quit
